---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { profile } from '../../data/profile';
---

<Section id="about" title="About" index="02">
  <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[#3a3122] dark:text-[#cfc2a7]">
    <p>
      I'm an {profile.title.toLowerCase()} based in {profile.location}. Most days I'm somewhere between computer vision, edge devices, messy datasets, and asking why the camera is mounted like that.
    </p>
    <p class="italic text-[#5a4e36] dark:text-[#b8a987]">
      I believe the best solution is often the smallest one — contained, boring, and easy to reason about. I work at LeftFields, help build Padelize as fractional CTO, and write here when something was annoying, interesting, or useful enough to remember.
    </p>
    <a href="/about" class="link-underline group inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-[#8a3a14] dark:text-[#e07a3e]">
      More about me
      <span class="transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</Section>
